		{
			dependencies: ["7192C8527301DC08", "39792D192AD44A70"]
			description: ["The &6UHV Energy Hatch&r is researched from the Sgr A* image, and the hull comes with it. Bring the Proxima data along, and keep heavy curium and uranium-233 in store."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_machine_hull"
