			title: "PMMA Wafer"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 33.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7F5A9C113BBA2A9D"]
			description: ["The &6Exposed Wafer&r: The X-rays have cut the pattern deep into the PMMA. Made in the &6Synchrotron&r from the PMMA Wafer, with liquid helium, in the cleanroom. Developed by the synchrotron (circuit 2). The LIGA-Patterned Wafer in the Synchrotron. Stock it by ME and let the next step pull it; nothing here needs a hand."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:exposed_wafer"
			id: "50439A1D2A4E861D"
